# 统一换行符策略 + 二进制保护（Phase 0-0.6）
* text=auto eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.glb binary
*.fbx binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webm binary
*.mp4 binary
*.ico binary
